<title>USA: SangStat sells 2.6 mln shrs at $30/shr.</title>
<headline>SangStat sells 2.6 mln shrs at $30/shr.</headline>
<dateline>MENLO PARK, Calif. 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>SangStat Medical Corp said on Friday it sold 2.6 million shares of its common stock at $30 per share via a public offering.</p>
<p>The offering was being managed by Hambrecht &amp; Quist LLC, Montgomery Securities and Robertson, Stephens &amp; Co, the company said.</p>
<p>The company said it granted underwriters an option to buy up to 390,000 additional shares solely to cover over-allotments.</p>
<p>--New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
